        "results_interpretation": "The pooled analysis of 48 studies yielded an overall effect size of 0.71 (95% CI: 0.63\u20130.8), suggesting that folic acid is associated with a lower risk of breast cancer. However, this association should be interpreted with caution, as there was very high between-study heterogeneity (I\u00b2 = 88.99%), reflecting highly inconsistent results across studies."
